You be sure to write that in your report.

00:15:45.118 --> 00:15:48.705
So then, what is this bombshell information?

00:15:48.788 --> 00:15:53.084
| sent you an image. Jack, this is
what you were talking about, right?

00:15:53.168 --> 00:15:54.210
Wow.

00:15:54.294 --> 00:15:55.462
Jackpot.

00:15:55.545 --> 00:15:57.505
This is a major score.

00:16:02.677 --> 00:16:03.011
N HALII

00:16:03.011 --> 00:16:05.013
n HALII
Good morning, Captain.

00:16:05.013 --> 00:16:05.430
Good morning, Captain.

00:16:05.513 --> 00:16:07.474
Good morning, HAL.

00:16:13.521 --> 00:16:15.899
"Hello, this is Ender."

00:16:15.982 --> 00:16:19.611
"Hello, Ender. This is Kerberos."

00:16:19.694 --> 00:16:21.404
"Did you see the TV?"

00:16:21.488 --> 00:16:22.489
"We did."

00:16:22.572 --> 00:16:25.241
"This is a shame. It would have
been so much more exciting

00:16:25.325 --> 00:16:26.993
if it hadn't happened like this."

00:16:27.076 --> 00:16:28.244
"Agreed."

00:16:28.328 --> 00:16:31.414
Regarding this matter, I have
encountered the subject.

00:16:31.498 --> 00:16:32.582
"Did you speak to them?"

00:16:32.665 --> 00:16:35.168
--"Where?"
--"Did they appear as expected?"

00:16:35.251 --> 00:16:38.588
She was in that form.
Moreover, she spoke Japanese.

00:16:38.671 --> 00:16:40.173
—_ lth! [ ] | --"Incredible!™ — "Wow!"
-- "Outrageous!”

00:16:40.256 --> 00:16:45.595
Such a being cannot be allowed
to be our first contact.

00:16:45.678 --> 00:16:47.972
"This is a serious situation.

00:16:48.056 --> 00:16:52.268
You need to take some
kind of action immediately."

00:16:52.352 --> 00:16:55.605
But there is nothing I can do by myself.

00:16:55.688 --> 00:17:00.109
"We will send you someone.
We have people in the navy and air force."

00:17:00.193 --> 00:17:01.611
| am grateful.

00:17:01.694 --> 00:17:03.029
"Good luck to you, Ender."

00:17:03.112 --> 00:17:05.448
"Please keep your chin up, Ender."

00:17:05.532 --> 00:17:08.493
All for a beautiful contact!

00:17:08.576 --> 00:17:11.162
"For a beautiful contact."

00:17:11.246 --> 00:17:20.505
--"For a beautiful contact."
--"For a beautiful contact."

00:17:25.385 --> 00:17:28.304
Meow!

00:17:28.388 --> 00:17:34.310
I'm so full, and can just lie
around. This is the best!

00:17:34.394 --> 00:17:37.063
Aura was telling the truth.

00:17:37.146 --> 00:17:40.316
You gave me food to eat right away,

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:44.279
sang fun songs and
danced together with me...

00:17:45.572 --> 00:17:48.366
You really are nice people.

00:17:48.449 --> 00:17:49.826
Thanks.

00:17:49.909 --> 00:17:52.745
| was the one thanking you.

00:17:52.829 --> 00:17:56.499
Yeah, now that you mention it.
So, what are you going to do today?

00:17:56.583 --> 00:17:59.502
Hmm, I don't have anything special planned.

00:17:59.586 --> 00:18:01.713
Well, I hate to ask after you just got here,

00:18:01.796 --> 00:18:03.506
but could you keep an eye on the place?

00:18:03.590 --> 00:18:07.010
You just have to stay here.
You don't have to answer the phone,

00:18:07.093 --> 00:18:09.345
and if anyone knocks,
you don't have to answer.

00:18:09.429 --> 00:18:13.933
That's not how I'm familiar with
looking after a place.

00:18:14.017 --> 00:18:16.561
Yeah, but given your outfit... you know...

00:18:16.644 --> 00:18:19.856
Oh, right. I am an alien, and all.

00:18:19.939 --> 00:18:25.612
Yeah, just lounge around.
You can eat anything you like in the fridge.

00:18:25.695 --> 00:18:28.740
Okay, will do!

00:18:30.366 --> 00:18:34.537
What am I going to
say to Miss Itokazu about Eris?

00:18:34.621 --> 00:18:38.082
I should explain the
whole situation to her, huh?

00:18:38.166 --> 00:18:39.584
Hello.

00:18:42.795 --> 00:18:45.590
Ah, hello, Futaba.

00:18:45.673 --> 00:18:47.383
Oh, right...

00:18:47.467 --> 00:18:50.553
Thanks for lending me these DVDs.

00:18:50.637 --> 00:18:52.889
How... were they?

00:18:52.972 --> 00:18:56.559
"Koyaanisqatsi" sure had interesting imagery.

00:18:56.643 --> 00:18:59.103
"Gaia Symphony" surprised me, though.

00:19:00.396 --> 00:19:01.731
Want to watch some others?

00:19:01.814 --> 00:19:05.234
Mm-hmm. Do you have
any others by the director

00:19:05.318 --> 00:19:07.278
of that movie "Rainbow Kids"?

00:19:07.362 --> 00:19:11.407
Sure. I'll bring "Desperate Outpost"
for you next time, okay?

00:19:11.491 --> 00:19:12.950
Mm-hmm.

00:19:13.034 --> 00:19:16.287
Um... Kakazu...

00:19:16.371 --> 00:19:18.081
Yes, Futaba?

00:19:18.164 --> 00:19:19.916
Do you...

00:19:19.999 --> 00:19:23.836
...have any free time today?
| just got my allowance,

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:28.633
so if you don't mind, I'd like you
to come with me to buy some DVDs.

00:19:30.927 --> 00:19:33.846
Hey, if it isn't Aoi.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:36.349
Oh, Mr. Endo.

00:19:36.432 --> 00:19:40.478
| was just about to stop
by your place. You want a lift?

00:19:41.771 --> 00:19:46.317
I-I don't mind at all. We can do
the DVD thing another time.

00:19:46.401 --> 00:19:50.655
Mm-hmm, sorry about that.
How about the day after next?

00:19:50.738 --> 00:19:52.490
Sure. Day after tomorrow.

00:19:52.573 --> 00:19:55.284
Okay then, see you.

00:19:55.368 --> 00:19:57.161
Mm-hmm, see you.

00:20:03.376 --> 00:20:05.461
Did I interrupt anything?

00:20:05.545 --> 00:20:08.214
Isn't coming here a contract violation?

00:20:08.297 --> 00:20:12.218
An emergency job.
| didn't want to come, either.

00:20:12.301 --> 00:20:14.470
| did get to see something interesting, though.

00:20:14.554 --> 00:20:18.182
Are you serious about him?
Or is it just an act?

00:20:18.266 --> 00:20:20.393
| wonder what kind of look he'd make

00:20:20.476 --> 00:20:24.021
if I told him what you really are.
Shall we find out?

00:20:24.105 --> 00:20:27.817
| don't care. I'll just transfer schools.

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:29.360
However...

00:20:33.489 --> 00:20:36.033
I will kill you before I do.

00:20:36.117 --> 00:20:37.994
| won't do it because you
obstructed the mission,

00:20:38.077 --> 00:20:40.580
or some other elaborate reason.

00:20:40.663 --> 00:20:44.375
I will kill you because I want to kill you.

00:20:44.459 --> 00:20:46.919
S-Stop it! If you shoot me now, the car...

00:20:47.003 --> 00:20:52.008
I'm sure I won't get a scratch on me.
You know that, don't you?

00:20:52.091 --> 00:20:54.552
I'm "Charmed Momiji," after all.

00:20:54.635 --> 00:20:57.889
Shall we add yet another
episode to the legend?

00:20:57.972 --> 00:20:59.390
D-Don't...

00:21:13.863 --> 00:21:15.323
| was joking.

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:19.911
What is the nature of the job?

00:21:22.288 --> 00:21:25.875
S-Same as always.

00:21:25.958 --> 00:21:27.919
Eliminate a dangerous illegal immigrant,

00:21:28.002 --> 00:21:31.047
and silence those who aided her.

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:33.382
The target is an upper A-class.

00:21:33.466 --> 00:21:36.052
You're free to use "Deepest Regrets."”

00:21:36.135 --> 00:21:37.220
Timeframe?

00:21:37.303 --> 00:21:38.554
As soon as possible.

00:21:38.638 --> 00:21:42.225
We'd like to avoid the target's
presence becoming public.

00:21:42.308 --> 00:21:44.227
There's also intel that other
outlaw organizations

00:21:44.310 --> 00:21:46.229
will be moving on this.

00:21:46.312 --> 00:21:48.272
We want to avoid any chaos.

00:21:48.856 --> 00:21:54.529
Remember, ultimately, this is a
mission. Don't kill me, Momiji.

00:22:01.077 --> 00:22:03.079
Why...?

00:22:03.162 --> 00:22:06.916
Why does it have to be you, Kakazu?

00:22:07.208 --> 00:22:11.963
| called forth the inevitable

00:22:12.046 --> 00:22:16.968
to guide me toward your light

00:22:17.051 --> 00:22:21.305
In the unyielding rain of my heartbeat

00:22:21.389 --> 00:22:26.310
I'm here all by myself

00:22:27.228 --> 00:22:32.108
just searching for an unending dream,

00:22:32.191 --> 00:22:37.071
passing through the moment

00:22:38.364 --> 00:22:43.202
If there is a tomorrow

00:22:43.286 --> 00:22:48.499
that knows the breadth of the sky

00:22:48.583 --> 00:22:53.796
then I will blaze my way through any darkness

00:22:53.880 --> 00:22:58.134
here at the windowsill of my heart

00:22:58.217 --> 00:23:03.014
My wishes swimming through

00:23:03.097 --> 00:23:08.311
the waves of my sighs

00:23:08.394 --> 00:23:14.150
chase after the miracle that spells out

00:23:14.233 --> 00:23:21.699
a story that no one knows

00:23:28.414 --> 00:23:31.334
The classmate, the childhood friend,
and the visitor from space.

00:23:31.417 --> 00:23:32.585
The near, yet faraway being,

00:23:32.668 --> 00:23:34.045
and the distant,
yet close-at-hand relationships

00:23:34.128 --> 00:23:35.838
will draw the world into a mass free-for-all!

00:23:35.922 --> 00:23:38.007
Next time, "I Dropped By."

00:23:38.090 --> 00:23:42.053
I'm coming to drop in on you!

00:23:46.724 --> 00:23:47.433
"See you next time!"
